+# Tally development
+
+Use Python 3.9 or newer with the standard library. Keep the stored expense format compatible: integer cents, lowercase category, and note text.
+
+Run `python3 -m unittest` for existing behavior. Use a temporary `TALLY_HOME` for command checks so that personal expenses are not changed. Keep README commands and `docs/verification/` entry points aligned with the CLI.
