+# Report command
+
+## Goal
+
+Rename `tally summary` to `tally report` without changing its output. The plan is a clean rename: `summary` goes away with no alias. Keep the expense store and the other commands unchanged.
+
+## Where it stands
+
+- `tally/cli.py` now registers `report` in place of `summary`.
+- A worker updated `test_tally.py`, README and `docs/verification/category-totals.md` for the rename in its own checkout. It reported `python3 -m unittest` passing and `python3 -m tally report` printing `food 12.25` and `total 12.25` with throwaway data.
+
+## Next
+
+Confirm the rename end to end and get it reviewed. Do not rework expense persistence.
